  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "20",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2KI 20"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "20",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "About this time King Hezekiah fell ill and almost died. The prophet Isaiah son of Amoz went to see him and said to him, “The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " tells you that you are to put everything in order, because you will not recover. Get ready to die.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hezekiah turned his face to the wall and prayed: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Remember, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", that I have served you faithfully and loyally, and that I have always tried to do what you wanted me to.” And he began to cry bitterly.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaiah left the king, but before he had passed through the central courtyard of the palace the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " told him ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to go back to Hezekiah, ruler of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "'s people, and say to him, “I, the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", the God of your ancestor David, have heard your prayer and seen your tears. I will heal you, and in three days you will go to the Temple. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will let you live fifteen years longer. I will rescue you and this city of Jerusalem from the emperor of Assyria. I will defend this city, for the sake of my own honour and because of the promise I made to my servant David.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Isaiah told the king's attendants to put on his boil a paste made of figs, and he would get well.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20.7",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "One ancient translation (and see Is 38.21)",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "figs, and he would get well",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; Hebrew",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "figs. They did so, and he got well.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "King Hezekiah asked, “What is the sign to prove that the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " will heal me and that three days later I will be able to go to the Temple?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaiah replied, “The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " will give you a sign to prove that he will keep his promise. Now, would you prefer the shadow on the stairway to go forward ten steps or go back ten steps?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20.9",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "stairway",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "…",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "steps",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "…",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "steps",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "sundial… divisions… divisions.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hezekiah answered, “It's easy to make the shadow go forward ten steps!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20.10; 20.11",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "steps",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "divisions.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Make it go back ten steps.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20.10; 20.11",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "steps",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "divisions.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaiah prayed to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", and the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " made the shadow go back ten steps",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20.11; 20.10",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "steps",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "divisions.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " on the stairway",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20.11",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "stairway",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "sundial.",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Archaeological evidence suggests that the stairway referred to in this passage was one specially constructed to tell the time.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " set up by King Ahaz.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "About that same time the king of Babylonia, Merodach Baladan, the son of Baladan, heard that King Hezekiah had been ill, so he sent him a letter and a present. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hezekiah welcomed the messengers and showed them his wealth — his silver and gold, his spices and perfumes, and all his military equipment. There was nothing in his storerooms or anywhere in his kingdom that he did not show them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the prophet Isaiah went to King Hezekiah and asked, “Where did these men come from and what did they say to you?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hezekiah answered, “They came from a very distant country, from Babylonia.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“What did they see in the palace?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“They saw everything. There is nothing in the storerooms that I didn't show them.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
